  "url": "http://www.aelhealth.com",
  "about": "Incorporated in September 2003, Aprameya Engineering Limited specializes in installing and maintaining Intensive Care Units (ICU), Neonatal Intensive Care Units (NICU), Pediatric Intensive Care Units (PICU), Operation Theatres, and prefabricated structure wards in hospitals and medical care centers.[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Business Segments\nA) Healthcare Infrastructure Projects[1][2]\nThe company offers turnkey solutions for developing healthcare facilities, covering everything from design to execution of ICUs, NICUs, PICUs, Modular Operation Theatres (MOTs), Dialysis Centers, and Prefabricated Wards. The scope also includes integration of MEP systems, fire safety, structural design, and hospital interiors. These projects are tailored for public healthcare institutions, focused on customized infrastructure delivery.",
